trepštine u Bujštini. Digitron je pomagao bujsku kulturu, sport, srednju školu &quot;Vladimir Gortan&quot;, dom umirovljenika... <br/></div><div class="qr-and-instructions"><div class="qr-container"><img src="/assets/images/final/image.png" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div><div data-hero-variant="desktop" class="heroheader05_image-wrapper"><div class="image-group"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/bujanje-20buja-20-20tvornica-20digitron.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" height="" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 372.7734375px, 38vw" alt="Izgradnja nove zgrade za brojne radnike Digitrona" data-srcset="/assets/images/final/bujanje-20buja-20-20tvornica-20digitron-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/bujanje-20buja-20-20tvornica-20digitron.png 700w" class="heroheader05_image image-size"/><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="image background" class="image-background"/><div class="w-layout-hflex ar-and-copyright"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/ar-20ikona-20-20s.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="irene stvarnosti" class="image-2"/><div class="text-copyright-or-title">Tradicionalni kineski abacus</div></div></div><div class="qr-and-instructions tablet"><div class="qr-container"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/image.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/bujanje-20buja-20-20zahvalnice-20i-20priredbe-202.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/bujanje-20buja-20-20zahvalnice-20i-20priredbe-202-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/bujanje-20buja-20-20zahvalnice-20i-20priredbe-202.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 76vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 69vw, 31vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div id="w-node-_3643c856-a17c-8c07-fd3a-b39e0c7b2f3d-97348d55" class="layout58_content"><div class="text-size-large-2">Najviše zbog potreba Digitrona u Bujama je 1973. otvoren odsjek zagrebačke Visoke škole za vanjsku trgovinu, što je do danas ostala jedina visokoškolska ustanova koja je djelovala na području grada Buja.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component image-right"><div id="w-node-_3643c856-a17c-8c07-fd3a-b39e0c7b2f61-97348d55" class="layout58_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium">Više radnika - više stanovnika<br/></h3></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Broj stanovnika naselja Buje 1971. godine iznosio je 1967, dok je 1981. već bilo 2824 stanovnika. Napočetku, 1971. godine, u Digitronu je radilo 26 zaposlenika, dok im se 1987.broj popeo do gotovo 770. <br/><br/>&quot;Buje-export&quot; je, ponajviše zbog velikog broja radnika Digitrona, u svojim prostorima organizirao zubarsku i očnu ambulantu.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-medium heading-duplicated">Više radnika - više stanovnika<br/></h3><div class="featured-image-group image-group-mobile-bigger"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="image-background"/><img src="/assets/images/final/graf-20broja-20stanovnika-20u-20bujama-20-20osnutak-20digitrona.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/graf-20broja-20stanovnika-20u-20bujama-20-20osnutak-20digitrona-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/graf-20broja-20stanovnika-20u-20bujama-20-20osnutak-20digitrona.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 84vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 69vw, 33vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-medium heading-duplicated">Društveno odgovorna tvrtka<br/></h3><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/drus-cc-8ctveno-20odgovorna-20tvrtka.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/drus-cc-8ctveno-20odgovorna-20tvrtka-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/drus-cc-8ctveno-20odgovorna-20tvrtka.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 76vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 69vw, 31vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div id="w-node-c06c64ef-fd6e-a42d-7833-cd3ace6c5ebf-97348d55" class="layout58_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium hide-heading3">Društveno odgovorna tvrtka<br/></h3></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Iz izvještaja Radničkog savjeta vidi se da je Digitron potpomagao osnovnoškolce iz Buja plaćajući im školske ekskurzije i donirajući im svoje proizvode. <br/><br/>Osim toga pomagalo se i Udruženju distrofičara Hrvatske, ĐŒakavskom saboru, Povijesnom društvu Hrvatska - Podružnica za Istru, Muzičkoj omladini Hrvatske, Savezu slijepih BIH...</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>